uly awesome. Features include peaked 22' ceilings in most rooms. All custom built woodwork (doors, kitchen, trims, 1000 book library shelving and details). Large office space could be converted to a 3rd bedroom. Other features include home theater, 3 fireplaces, audio wiring and 2 huge balconies. If you love the cold stark plain white walls in the newer buildings at $500-700 PSF away you go or you can pay half as much for twice the space. Unobstructed river valley views. This is a must see in our town. All this at $300 Per square foot (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$850,000"],["Type","Condo"],["Style","Penthouse"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,583 sq ft"],["Year built","2004"],["Condo fee","$1,486 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Downtown"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5K2Y4"],["MLS® number","E4512469"],["Listed","October 9, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Garburator, Hood Fan, Furniture, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat, Baseboard heaters"],["Fireplace","Electric"],["Parking","Underground, Indoor, Heated Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Caretaker, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","20.00 m × 24.00 m (65'7\" × 78'9\")"],["Dining room","Main level","15.00 m × 10.50 m (49'3\" × 34'5\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","16.50 m × 14.00 m (54'2\" × 45'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","23.50 m × 18.00 m (77'1\" × 59'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","16.50 m × 14.00 m (54'2\" × 45'11\")"],["Office","Upper Level","13.50 m × 11.00 m (44'3\" × 36'1\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","10.00 m × 11.00 m (32'10\" × 36'1\")"],["Media","Upper Level","17.50 m × 12.00 m (57'5\" × 39'4\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","10.00 m × 11.00 m (32'10\" × 36'1\")"],["Library","Upper Level","21.00 m × 6.50 m (68'11\" × 21'4\")"]],"courtesy":"Trevo